        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn SM9BG, Smooth Black Iron Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis item is being discontinued.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA single cylinder, the deadbolt is thrown and retracted from the interior by a thumbturn while, from the exterior, it is key operated. The cylinder guard prevents it being wrenched from the door; and the hardened pin prevents cutting through the bolt. The tiebolt construction secures the deadbolt into one tough monolithic unit. The Acorn SM9BG is easy to install and will fit standard predrilled bore holes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>5 pin tumbler.</li>\r\n<li>Nickel plated silver pins.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible and will fit standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Smooth Black Iron Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Smooth Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: fits 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Square strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Crossbore: 2-1/8\", Edgebore: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
